          .num_remark
            %h6#remark Remark
            %p
              Without the assumption of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/proper+action"} proper action
              in Prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#FixedLociOfSmoothProperActionsAreSubmanifolds"}
              the conclusion generally fails. See
              %a{:href => "https://math.stackexchange.com/a/1739768/58526"} this MO comment
              for a counter-example.
          %h2#properties Properties
          %h3#FixedPointAdjunction Fixed point adjunction
          %p
            For
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi G
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G
